      "extract": "Probing the Origin of Neutrino Mass: from GUT to LHC Goran Senjanovi´c ICTP, Trieste, Italy Abstract Ever since the Majorana classic work, the nature of neutrino has been one of the central questions of the weak interaction physics. If neutrino is its own antiparticle, the immediate consequence is lepton number violation through the neutrinoless double beta decay. However, colliders such as the LHC oﬀer a hope of",
