      "extract": "Large scale see-saw: GUT Large scale seesaw allows for Yukawas of order one. This happens naturally in grand uniﬁed theories (GUT). Let us see the situation in the most popular candidates, SO(10) and SU(5) GUTs. 2 p p m x e e n n W W lightest neutrino mass in eV normal inverted |mee ν | in eV 10−4 0.001 0.01 0.1 1 10−4 10−3 0.01 0.1 1.0 Figure 1: Neutrinoless double beta decay through the neutrino Majorana mass",
