      "extract": "More SU(5) We saw that uniﬁcation predicts the mass of the fermion triplet below TeV, and thus it becomes accessible to the colliders such as Tevatron and LHC. It can be produced through gauge interactions (Drell-Yan) pp →W ± + X →T ±T 0 + X pp →(Z or γ) + X →T +T −+ X . The best channel is like-sign dileptons + jets BR(T ±T 0 →l± i l± j + 4jets) ≈1 20 × |yi T|2|yj T|2 (P k |yk T|2)2 Same couplings yi T contribute",
